We then use the `Collectors.toMap()` method to convert the stream into a map, where the key is the `firstName` property of each `Person` object and the value is the entire `Person` object. The `Collectors.toMap()` method takes a function that specifies how to map the stream elements to the key and value of the map, which in this case is the `getFirstName()` method of the `Person` class.

