The `` find_4_digit_primes `` function generates a list of 4-digit prime numbers by iterating over the numbers from 1000 to 10010 and checking whether each number is a prime number using the `` is_prime `` function. The list of prime numbers is returned as the result.

Finally, the code prints out the list of 4-digit prime numbers.

